{"title":"Friva Clover","slug":"Friva_Clover","pageid":3981,"revid":20710,"timestamp":"2025-12-11T21:55:45Z","lastEditor":"Anty2013","categories":["Trees"],"infobox":{"type":"Objects","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Finlay"},{"label":"Function","value":"Tree"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.49.0"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>The <b>Friva Clover</b> is a pink clover that was introduced in the 2025 Valentine's day event. They spawn uncommonly in the sakura tree highlands of the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flowering_Meadows/\">Flowering Meadows</a>.\n</p><p>Planked price: ~26 per stud<sup>3</sup>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Raw tree\">Raw tree</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Raw tree</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Planked\">Planked</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Planked</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Sanded\">Sanded</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Sanded </p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>"}
